  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Heute umfasst der Hof vier Hektar Weinberge mit Côtes du Rhône (Grenache, Syrah) in biologischer Landwirtschaft, die auf Biodynamik abzielt, sowie Mandel- und Aprikosenbäume."
    ],
    "en": [
      "We stopped here, in search of meaning, of resilience, of all-round benevolence and sharing.\r\n\r\nThe agricultural world is tough: such is the land, our days are quite the same and we believe that the requirement we have is at the expectation.\r\n\r\nOur quest for meaning revolves around a resilient agriculture that absorbs the shocks of recession, climate change, the progressive impoverishment of the livings.\r\n\r\nSince the beginning, we have been registered on various reception sites and sharing. We believe in the importance of the external view, of the criticism and sharing to better understand and adapt."
    ],
    "it": [
      "L'azienda vanta oggi quattro ettari di vigneti Côtes du Rhône (Grenache, Syrah) coltivati con metodo biologico in un'ottica di biodinamica, oltre a mandorli e albicocchi."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "La ferme compte aujourd’hui quatre hectares de vignes de Côtes du Rhône (Grenache, Syrah) en Agriculture Biologique visant la biodynamie, des amandiers et des abricotiers."
    ],
    "es": [
      "En la actualidad, la explotación cuenta con cuatro hectáreas de viñedos de Côtes du Rhône (garnacha, syrah) cultivados de forma ecológica y biodinámica, así como almendros y albaricoqueros."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "De boerderij heeft nu vier hectare Côtes du Rhône wijnstokken (Grenache, Syrah) die biologisch geteeld worden met het oog op biodynamica, evenals amandel- en abrikozenbomen."
    ]
  },
